@startuml
title Worker Discovers Job Posts

actor Worker as "Worker (User)"
participant DiscoveryPage as "Job Discovery Page (UI)"
participant JobPostServiceFE as "jobPostService.js"
participant JobPostController as "JobPostController (Backend)"
participant JobPostServiceBE as "JobPostService (Backend)"
database JobPostRepo as "JobPostRepository"

Worker -> DiscoveryPage: Mở trang tìm kiếm công việc
alt Tìm kiếm tất cả
    DiscoveryPage -> JobPostServiceFE: getAllOpenJobPosts()
    JobPostServiceFE -> JobPostController: GET /api/v1/job-posts/discover/open
else Lọc theo loại công việc
    Worker -> DiscoveryPage: Chọn một jobType
    DiscoveryPage -> JobPostServiceFE: getOpenJobPostsByJobType(jobType)
    JobPostServiceFE -> JobPostController: GET /api/v1/job-posts/discover/by-type?jobType=...
end

activate JobPostController
JobPostController -> JobPostServiceBE: getAllOpenJobPosts() hoặc getOpenJobPostsByJobType()
activate JobPostServiceBE

JobPostServiceBE -> JobPostRepo: findAllOpenJobPosts(now) hoặc findOpenJobPostsByJobType(jobType, now)
activate JobPostRepo
note right of JobPostRepo
  Query:
  SELECT j FROM JobPost j
  WHERE j.status = 'OPEN'
  AND j.scheduledAt > :now
end note
JobPostRepo --> JobPostServiceBE: Danh sách JobPost
deactivate JobPostRepo

JobPostServiceBE --> JobPostController: Trả về danh sách
deactivate JobPostServiceBE
JobPostController --> JobPostServiceFE: 200 OK
deactivate JobPostController

JobPostServiceFE --> DiscoveryPage: Dữ liệu Job Posts
DiscoveryPage -> Worker: Hiển thị danh sách công việc

== Người thợ xem chi tiết một công việc ==
Worker -> DiscoveryPage: Nhấp vào một công việc
DiscoveryPage -> JobPostServiceFE: getJobPostById(jobPostId)
JobPostServiceFE -> JobPostController: GET /api/v1/job-posts/{id}
note right of JobPostController: Đây là endpoint công khai
JobPostController -> JobPostServiceBE: getJobPostById(id)
JobPostServiceBE -> JobPostRepo: findById(id)
JobPostRepo --> JobPostServiceBE: Chi tiết JobPost
JobPostServiceBE --> JobPostController: Trả về JobPost
JobPostController --> JobPostServiceFE: 200 OK
JobPostServiceFE --> DiscoveryPage: Dữ liệu chi tiết
DiscoveryPage -> Worker: Hiển thị chi tiết công việc

@enduml